uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-none wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:10005\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/PixPin_2026-03-23_17-12-03-1024x348.png ,http:\/\/127.0.0.1:10005\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/PixPin_2026-03-23_17-12-03.png 780w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:10005\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/PixPin_2026-03-23_17-12-03.png 360w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 480px) 150px\" src=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:10005\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/PixPin_2026-03-23_17-12-03-1024x348.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"uag-image-1078\" width=\"802\" height=\"348\" title=\"PixPin_2026-03-23_17-12-03\" loading=\"lazy\" role=\"img\"\/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image uagb-block-080de2b0 wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-none wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:10005\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/PixPin_2026-03-23_17-12-36-1024x294.png ,http:\/\/127.0.0.1:10005\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/PixPin_2026-03-23_17-12-36.png 780w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:10005\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/PixPin_2026-03-23_17-12-36.png 360w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 480px) 150px\" src=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:10005\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/PixPin_2026-03-23_17-12-36-1024x294.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"uag-image-1079\" width=\"802\" height=\"294\" title=\"PixPin_2026-03-23_17-12-36\" loading=\"lazy\" role=\"img\"\/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"lab-experiment-caption has-medium-font-size\"><strong>BM-SKG \u4e0e SA-SKG \u5728\u5168\u90e8\u573a\u666f\u4e0b\u5c06\u6bd4\u7279\u9519\u8bef\u7387\uff08BER\uff09\u548c\u5bc6\u94a5\u9519\u8bef\u7387\uff08KER\uff09\u4fdd\u6301\u5728\u63a5\u8fd1 0 \u7684\u6c34\u5e73\uff0c\u540c\u65f6\u5206\u522b\u4ee5\u7ea6 27 \u6beb\u79d2\u548c 9 \u6beb\u79d2\u5b8c\u6210 128 \u6bd4\u7279\u7b49\u6548\u52a0\u5bc6\u5f3a\u5ea6\u7684\u5bc6\u94a5\u751f\u6210<\/strong>\uff1a\u5982\u539f\u6587 <strong>Fig. 7<\/strong> \u6240\u793a\uff0c\u5728\u56fa\u5b9a 64 \u4e2a\u7247\u6bb5\u3001\u7247\u6bb5\u957f\u5ea6\u4e3a 6 \u7684\u6761\u4ef6\u4e0b\uff0cSA-SKG \u5728\u5ba4\u5185\u5916\u79fb\u52a8\/\u9759\u6b62\u56db\u79cd\u573a\u666f\u4e0b BER \u548c KER \u5747\u4e3a 0\uff08\u9759\u6b62\u5ba4\u5185\u573a\u666f BER \u4ec5 0.0009\u3001KER \u4ec5 0.0068\uff09\uff0cBM-SKG \u540c\u6837\u63a5\u8fd1 0\uff1b\u5bf9\u6bd4\u7684\u516d\u79cd\u91cf\u5316\u57fa\u51c6\u65b9\u6cd5\u5728\u591a\u4e2a\u573a\u666f\u4e0b BER \u548c KER \u663e\u8457\u66f4\u9ad8\uff0c\u800c\u4e24\u79cd\u65b9\u6cd5\u7684\u5bc6\u94a5\u751f\u6210\u7387\uff08KGR = 1 bps\uff09\u4e0e\u5927\u591a\u6570\u57fa\u51c6\u76f8\u5f53\u3002<strong>Table I<\/strong> \u7684 NIST \u7edf\u8ba1\u6d4b\u8bd5\u7ed3\u679c\u8fdb\u4e00\u6b65\u8868\u660e\uff0cBM-SKG\u3001SA-SKG \u53ca\u5176\u4fe1\u9053\u590d\u7528\u7248\u672c\uff08BM-SKGr\u3001SA-SKGr\uff09\u5728\u5168\u90e8 9 \u9879\u6d4b\u8bd5\u4e2d\u5747\u4ee5 99% \u7f6e\u4fe1\u5ea6\u901a\u8fc7\uff0c\u9a8c\u8bc1\u4e86\u5bc6\u94a5\u7684\u9ad8\u968f\u673a\u6027\u3002<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-e3c2d50d lab-subheading\"><h3 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">\ud83d\udcdd \u5f15\u7528<\/h3><\/div>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code lab-bibtex-code has-small-font-size\"><code>@article{du2024bmskg,\n  author    = {Yicong Du and Huan Dai and Hongbo Liu and Yan Wang and Guyue Li and Yanzhi Ren and Yingying Chen and Ke Zhang},\n  title     = {Secret Key Generation Based on Manipulated Channel Measurement Matching},\n  journal   = {IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing},\n  volume    = {23},\n  number    = {10},\n  pages     = {9532--9548},\n  month     = oct,\n  year      = {2024},\n  doi       = {10.1109\/TMC.2024.3364909}\n}\n<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\" style=\"margin-top: